    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "topic": "Monday morning",
      "text": "It's Monday. The owner of **Chai Corner** hands you last week's orders and says: “Make me a tidy report I can send by lunch.”\n\nThere's nothing new to learn here. You'll use what you've practised in Topics 1 to 13, one job at a time, with less help as you go.\n\nThe **Amount** and **First name** columns are still empty. That's your first job.",
      "grid": [
        ["Server", "Item", "Qty", "Price", "Amount", "First name"],
        ["Kavya Nair", "Samosa", 40, 15, null, null],
        ["Imran Qureshi", "Chai", 100, 10, null, null],
        ["Joseph Dsouza", "Sandwich", 25, 60, null, null],
        ["Tanvi Patil", "Cold coffee", 30, 80, null, null],
        ["Harsh Vora", "Brownie", 16, 50, null, null],
        ["Lakshmi Menon", "Lassi", 30, 40, null, null]
      ],
      "activeCell": "A1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "formula",
      "topic": "Job 1: the first amount",
      "prompt": "Each order's **Amount** is its Qty times its Price. Work out the first one in ==E2==.",
      "grid": [
        ["Server", "Item", "Qty", "Price", "Amount", "First name"],
        ["Kavya Nair", "Samosa", 40, 15, null, null],
        ["Imran Qureshi", "Chai", 100, 10, null, null],
        ["Joseph Dsouza", "Sandwich", 25, 60, null, null],
        ["Tanvi Patil", "Cold coffee", 30, 80, null, null],
        ["Harsh Vora", "Brownie", 16, 50, null, null],
        ["Lakshmi Menon", "Lassi", 30, 40, null, null]
      ],
      "targetCell": "E2",
      "activeCell": "A1",
      "expectedValue": 600,
      "mustReference": ["C2", "D2"],
      "solution": "=C2*D2",
      "explain": "Kavya sold 40 samosas at 15 each: **600**. Using the cell addresses, not typed numbers, means the Amount follows if a Qty or Price changes.",
      "mobileButtons": ["=", "*"],
      "wrongFeedback": {
        "notFormula": "Start with `=` so Excel calculates.",
        "missingReference": "Point at the cells instead of typing the numbers: Qty is in `C2` and Price in `D2`.",
        "wrongValue": "Multiply Qty by Price: `C2` times `D2`."
      },
      "clues": ["`=C2*D2`: the star `*` means “times”."]
    },
    {
